      "text_raw": "Instead of an amplifier, a\ncascode can be taken as\nwell. Its advantage is that its\ninput impedance is resistive\nup to high frequencies and\ncan be set by the current.\nIndeed, it is the inverse\ntransconductance.\nHowever, a closer look\nreveals that several other\nfactors come in such as the\nparameter n (#1+g /g ),\nmB m\nand the output resistance\nr . They render the input\nDS\nresistance much less\naccurate.",
